output Sum;
output Cout;
```

The module should implement the following equation for Sum:

```
Sum = A ^ B ^ Cin;
```

and the following equation for Cout:

```
Cout = (A & B) | (Cin & (A ^ B));
```

Your module should be self-contained and should not rely on any external modules or libraries. Your module should also be no longer than 200 lines of Verilog code.

