Derive next-state logic equations and output logic equations by inspection assuming the following one-hot encoding is used: (S0, S1, S2, S3) = (4'b0001, 4'b0010, 4'b0100, 4'b1000). Implement only the state transition logic and output logic (the combinational logic portion) for this state machine.

