You are tasked with designing a verilog module for a 4-bit adder that will take in two 4-bit inputs (a and b) and output a 4-bit sum (s) and a carry out (c_out). The adder should be implemented using full adder sub-modules, which are provided in the code snippet below. Your module should be named "four_bit_adder".

